OL,3,GNEWSADad's stomach pain turned out to
OL,4,Abe 'invisible cancer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father-of-two whose cancer spread
OL,7,Ffrom his small bowel to his neck and
OL,8,Fspine before it was diagnosed has
OL,9,Freturned to the hospital that treated
OL,10,Fhim to raise awareness of an "invisible
OL,11,Fcancer".
OL,13,FDavid Corbin, 34, from Doncaster, said
OL,14,Fhe experienced fatigue, stomach issues,
OL,15,Fpain and coughing before being
OL,16,Fdiagnosed with neuroendocrine cancer in
OL,17,F2019 - a cancer that develops in the
OL,18,Fneuroendocrine system, which produces
OL,19,Fhormones.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
